---
title: Whitelabeling
description:
  Does your newsletter have sponsors? Learn how Buttondown can help you manage your sponsorships.
---

{% paidFeature feature="whitelabeling" /%}


At Buttondown, we have have several different options for whitelabeling your newsletters and archives.

- With any account (including free) we allow you to set [your own custom sending domain](/sending-from-a-custom-domain)
- With any _paid_ plan we allow full customization of [email](/designing-your-email) and [archive](/customizing-web-design) styling. We also allow you to host your newsletters archives from [your own custom domain](/hosting-domain).
- With the **Professional plan or higher**, we allow you to remove all mention of Buttondown. This includes our name in the footer of your emails.

You can learn more on our [pricing page](https://buttondown.com/pricing).

Not sure what plan is best for you? Send an email to [concierge@buttondown.com](mailto:concierge@buttondown.com) and let's chat!